::BeforeSupplyChainCh5
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}   Howzit, Quinn?
{@Quinn}    Howdy! We've been haulin' through space that cuts through pirate territory.
{@Player}   You were working near Velos? Callie's neighborhood?
{@Quinn}    Yeah. And Callie's been taunting ol' Ovill over on Frosch.
{@Quinn}    Locke, did you know that those two go way, way back? 
{@Player}   Are you saying they grew up together? Callie, from Frosch?!
{@Quinn}    That's right! Though Ovill wasn't exactly part of Callie's social circle.
{@Player}   Callie? Rich? What even happened?
{@Quinn}    Now that's a story I'd like to hear!


::AfterSupplyChainCh5
@trigger	    OnOverarchingLoaded 
@when 	        IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene
@once

{@Player}   Hey, bro, are those fabrication glitches fixed yet?
{@PAL}      Yes! Everything is in ERR_0x004F#@%NULL perfect shape!
{@Player}   Oh boy. I can't afford production issues.
{@Player}   Maybe I could ask Arken to come take a look.
{@PAL}      Frontier Robotics uses proprietary software. 
{@PAL}		Sorry, but only authorized technicians can service our systems!
